{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_ea48b5e3effc4110bf0d82e07a9ead1f","id":"pg_4e01fe98076754e18567ecf675d3a001","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/openbmb-pilotdeck-readme-docker-md-97633a08a73e-ecf675d3a001.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_11943b5e9e0250daa8f12dc4150b5f69"],"title":"OpenBMB/PilotDeck/README_DOCKER.md @ 97633a08a73e","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ea48b5e3effc4110bf0d82e07a9ead1f"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_0f1b91cc92b93d26e096484baf5445f4dc5bd6b1aebf80fb42557d110037cd1a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: contributions follow a fork, feature branch, and pull-request workflow, and bugs or feature requests go through GitHub Issues."},{"claim_ids":["clm_1514bca954507da6077cc47dfe99e0c4746f3602a85cbf7aa8e46ad417177ecf"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The system natively supports the Model Context Protocol (MCP) and is described as behaving consistently across Web, CLI, and IM front-ends."},{"claim_ids":["clm_29121366b984960178770f2b86797f3182694daa76db2f8371223a4b1998b4fa"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The installer requires Node.js 22.13+ and below v23 for the built-in SQLite runtime, and the Windows installer checks node:sqlite support and uses prebuilt native packages such as node-pty, better-sqlite3, bcrypt, and sharp."},{"claim_ids":["clm_330c7d586383df4b4d3f15f05bb7ed63bc959977788cd8f00361dc0437651d4a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The WorkSpace is the fundamental isolation unit: each project gets its own file system, memory store, and skill set, so parallel work does not interfere and retrieval stays scoped."},{"claim_ids":["clm_353d9a7d81fda036d67aa24bbca27f16df3d8c815e80f383cdcc589a5cb11f7e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"PilotDeck is an open-source agent operating system organized around a 'WorkSpace' concept, jointly developed by THUNLP, ModelBest, OpenBMB, and AI9Stars, targeting general-purpose multi-task scenarios."},{"claim_ids":["clm_3fca21040a10f86abb1ad201431e9a5425c52d01470b0fb53b7b7516b4e47214"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Smart Routing auto-detects task difficulty and sends complex calls to flagship models while simple tasks go to lighter sub-agent models, aiming to reduce token cost."},{"claim_ids":["clm_46f587a7b683a4f1df69d9c6499f7610eaf58734ad6090d611497fbaec330ea4"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The README reports benchmarks: on 7 complex tasks, a Sonnet 4.6 main plus MiniMax-M2.7 sub setup scored 70.6 at $3.15 versus 69.1 at $18.36 for a Sonnet 4.6 single agent, and Smart Routing cut a social-media workload's cost from $12.58 to $2.83."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6524358f8ea020f90c44269c575966149d3434d89aee58b1e6133b3ae65c0c51"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Configuration is read from ~/.pilotdeck/pilotdeck.yaml; if the file is missing, the Web UI starts without the Gateway, and saving a valid provider and key writes the config and starts the Gateway automatically."},{"claim_ids":["clm_7f1d60229243aa44a3a735bef6e286a2059571f7dd5c510c5a9e8bf18861b637"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: source installs use corepack pnpm with a committed pnpm-lock.yaml and workspace filters, and Git LFS demo media is skipped by default for a lightweight clone."},{"claim_ids":["clm_80c3f6bbe92b22ca892cc8aa682d73d0d7e22c2e5333ed8efdc9fc95a2b26f91"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Memory is white-box and traceable: generation, extraction, storage, and retrieval are visible, entries can be edited or deleted, and a Dream Mode consolidates memory in idle windows with one-click rollback."},{"claim_ids":["clm_990900e6c75a742ff4b2374cdf41f966989cdd96f3cedc57301a713e5a858d37"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The system supports always-on background execution: after the user signs off, the agent continues discovering tasks, running long-horizon monitors, and writing deliverables as local files with a summary report."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c49998f58098f61fcbb321b230105bd82a5b7f69bed7607b0bd060939eff54eb"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"PilotDeck ships a Web UI with WorkSpace management, white-box memory editing, and visualization of multi-agent collaboration; the 'pilotdeck' command starts the server at http://localhost:3001."},{"claim_ids":["clm_dffb020f6f5d6e1f8ada354fc07232594384f67d49a0e9626e78b0713830f1bf"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"An open plugin architecture separates the open-source core from plugin customization, supporting MCP servers, custom tools and skills, lifecycle hooks such as PreToolUse and UserPromptSubmit, and pluggable memory store providers."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f68da8f92fe9fcafcc131e07be048059a7e17c7092b7a4adbb49ff6227598d5a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The project is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f841e2cca6472ab1ed2a2f8332dcb4a371dc86a91bb4e88bd3249d259d920201"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Supported model provider protocols include OpenAI, Anthropic, native Google Gemini, DeepSeek, Qwen, Kimi, MiniMax, and other OpenAI-compatible endpoints, including local Ollama without an API key."}],"claim_ids":["clm_0f1b91cc92b93d26e096484baf5445f4dc5bd6b1aebf80fb42557d110037cd1a","clm_1514bca954507da6077cc47dfe99e0c4746f3602a85cbf7aa8e46ad417177ecf","clm_29121366b984960178770f2b86797f3182694daa76db2f8371223a4b1998b4fa","clm_330c7d586383df4b4d3f15f05bb7ed63bc959977788cd8f00361dc0437651d4a","clm_353d9a7d81fda036d67aa24bbca27f16df3d8c815e80f383cdcc589a5cb11f7e","clm_3fca21040a10f86abb1ad201431e9a5425c52d01470b0fb53b7b7516b4e47214","clm_46f587a7b683a4f1df69d9c6499f7610eaf58734ad6090d611497fbaec330ea4","clm_6524358f8ea020f90c44269c575966149d3434d89aee58b1e6133b3ae65c0c51","clm_7f1d60229243aa44a3a735bef6e286a2059571f7dd5c510c5a9e8bf18861b637","clm_80c3f6bbe92b22ca892cc8aa682d73d0d7e22c2e5333ed8efdc9fc95a2b26f91","clm_990900e6c75a742ff4b2374cdf41f966989cdd96f3cedc57301a713e5a858d37","clm_c49998f58098f61fcbb321b230105bd82a5b7f69bed7607b0bd060939eff54eb","clm_dffb020f6f5d6e1f8ada354fc07232594384f67d49a0e9626e78b0713830f1bf","clm_f68da8f92fe9fcafcc131e07be048059a7e17c7092b7a4adbb49ff6227598d5a","clm_f841e2cca6472ab1ed2a2f8332dcb4a371dc86a91bb4e88bd3249d259d920201"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_ea48b5e3effc4110bf0d82e07a9ead1f","id":"pg_5ac75a1bac185f6eb48230f9486627de","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/openbmb-pilotdeck-readme-md-97633a08